@startuml c1-context
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Context.puml

title rag-pavimentos-mvp: C1 System context diagram

AddRelTag("pending", $lineStyle=DashedLine(), $legendText="Method pending (ADR)")

' Actors and the use cases each one performs (docs/use-cases/).
' Every person signs in (UC-07). Load, correct and delete, and manage access
' depend on per-project permissions granted in UC-08.
' UC-06 actors are an [assumption] (see uc-06-view-pci-in-project.md).
' UC-09 is shown for users who load data [assumption]; any user can receive
' the Correct and delete permission.
Person(airport_staff, "Airport pavement management staff", "Loads airfield PCI data, selects M&R candidates, reports condition and plans inspections.")
Person(pm_engineer, "Pavement management engineer", "Loads PCI data, selects M&R candidates and reports network condition.")
Person(district_staff, "District/maintenance staff", "Selects M&R candidates and plans inspections on assigned sections.")
Person(consultant, "Continuum consultant", "Secondary user. Loads client PCI data on the client's behalf and answers client requests.")

' Separate client role confirmed. The role name is a placeholder.
Person(data_admin, "Client data administrator", "Separate client role that loads the client's PCI data files.")

' Access management roles. The scope of each is an [assumption] (see uc-08-manage-project-access.md).
Person(client_manager, "Client manager", "Manager at the agency or airport. Grants and removes access to the client's projects.")
Person(project_lead, "Project lead", "Person responsible for a project. Grants and removes access to that project.")
Person(continuum_admin, "Continuum administrator", "Continuum staff. Sets up each client and its first client manager, and can grant project access.")

System(platform, "Pavement data platform MVP", "Stores PCI data (section, coordinates, PCI, year) for each client's airport or road networks across all survey years. Answers natural-language questions with source rows and tables, and shows PCI in project and section views. Access is granted per project.")

' External system. PCI data reach the MVP in two ways (ADR 2026-11-23-load-pci-data-by-upload-and-connection):
' people upload CSV or Excel files, and, for the funding agency only, an automatic connection to this system.
' The connection method, and so the direction of the arrow, is decided in a later ADR.
' Sign-in method not decided (UC-07): an identity provider is not shown until it is.
System_Ext(pms, "Client pavement management system", "Existing client database with PCI records per section and survey year, with coordinates. Airport or road network.")

Rel(airport_staff, platform, "Signs in; uploads and corrects PCI data; asks questions; views project and section PCI", "UC-01 to UC-07, UC-09")
Rel(pm_engineer, platform, "Signs in; uploads and corrects PCI data; asks questions; views project and section PCI", "UC-01, UC-02, UC-03, UC-05, UC-06, UC-07, UC-09")
Rel(district_staff, platform, "Signs in; asks questions; views project and section PCI", "UC-01, UC-04, UC-06, UC-07")
Rel(consultant, platform, "Signs in; uploads and corrects PCI data; asks questions; views project and section PCI", "UC-01, UC-02, UC-05, UC-06, UC-07, UC-09")

Rel(data_admin, platform, "Signs in; uploads and corrects PCI data files (section, coordinates, PCI, year)", "UC-05, UC-07, UC-09")

Rel(client_manager, platform, "Signs in; grants and removes access to the client's projects", "UC-07, UC-08")
Rel(project_lead, platform, "Signs in; grants and removes access to their project", "UC-07, UC-08")
Rel(continuum_admin, platform, "Sets up clients and their first manager; grants and removes project access", "UC-07, UC-08")

Rel(platform, pms, "Automatic connection for the funding agency: PCI records (section, coordinates, PCI, year); method pending", "UC-05", $tags="pending")

SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
